{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6639488a67c4913147bf260c9b4adadb3106f0bdfbf3e45b7c75a1f4bffb866a", "ja": "（瑞希から「相談したいことがある」と呼び出された。\n今度のグラビア撮影の件かな……？）", "zh": "（瑞希把我叫出来，说有件事想商量。是关于下次写真拍摄的事吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "6262d02ba6e721410a6983230ddc07914446c699ccdfb2e3083f6c79d5497c9c", "ja": "急にすみません。ですが、{$P$}を\n頼るのが一番かと思いまして。", "zh": "突然叫您过来，真是不好意思。但我还是觉得，\n来向{$P$}求助是最好的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1002_p", "source_sha256": "724a77c138f71bee1e48fe5625b8380ac80793534a948c935b4bb69aab0e5aff", "ja": "構わないよ。\nそれで、相談したいことって？", "zh": "没关系。\n所以，你想找我商量什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "35ac2d4789ae38b749104fed2fe5e04d6c4b5ca97d03080fe5bf6741769faeeb", "ja": "相談というより、お願いかもしれません。\nその……私のことを、たくさん褒めてくれませんか？", "zh": "与其说是商量，不如说可能是个请求。\n那个……您能不能多夸夸我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1004_p", "source_sha256": "048a44eae0b573617aca8df395a98067b98871db746e8b1a3ee1f54a0e8251f3", "ja": "うん？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "嗯？这话是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "c0be779b5db9646aff79cc664423343c24237d87d56c2dfeac31771046f27481", "ja": "ご覧の通り、この衣装はいつも以上に\n着ている人のスタイルが強調されるかと。", "zh": "正如您所见，这套服装应该会比平时更加凸显穿着者的身材。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "039e020cd37ab93806846ee8892957e7e9c71e30a2bd40a775f7f4685ae28bcc", "ja": "試着をしてみましたが、私では若干の力、というか、\nボリュームの不足を感じています。……うぐぐ。", "zh": "我试穿了一下，感觉以我的条件，有些力道……也就是说，分量有点不够。……唔呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1007_p", "source_sha256": "71987f4aae80163114499951ed41eea447e034c46f467ec8b9f4fd5be734a576", "ja": "そんなことはないと思うけど……。\n撮影に向けて、自信をつけたいってことかな？", "zh": "我觉得不是这样的……。\n你是想在拍摄前增强自信，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "ff3cd865b595bc477b12767111a6a7d7f0efcfcb83c0827ee9f9d2050f95abc7", "ja": "はい。{$P$}に褒められると、\n不思議と、胸のあたりがポカポカしてきて……。", "zh": "是的。被{$P$}夸奖时，不知为何，胸口就会暖洋洋的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "f089ca51fcbb8163563b86f45742aa70c5a2e00ec2be5f239bd66463f17edf50", "ja": "まるで、魔法のように。\n不安な気持ちが、どこかへ消えてしまいます。", "zh": "就像被施了魔法一样。\n不安的心情，不知不觉就消失得无影无踪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f9adcde88c7af48a960e79bfe005a65ab81f9b9fe8fdf98f9a661fefb59fec1", "ja": "褒めるところが、あまり見当たらないかも\nしれませんが。グラビア成功のため、お願いします。", "zh": "可能不太找得到值得夸奖的地方。不过，为了写真拍摄成功，拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cfe88ef2ce76911a4b2fbda0beab0c865e00bc954b9a6914b86d3ae52032bf99", "ja": "見当たらないって、いやいや。\nどこから褒めていいか迷うぐらい、似合ってるよ！", "zh": "什么叫找不到？哪里的话。\n我都不知道从哪里夸起，你穿上去真的太合适了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "89c6e91bf91ce2cde7ed44148cf3e9582ef7520ae7f7eff6890d95ac5ab72b36", "ja": "なんと。……そんなに、ですか？\nすみませんが、詳しく教えてください。", "zh": "什么……有那么夸张吗？\n不好意思，请详细告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_1013", "source_sha256": "98eedc2a1e4cadc1f6e6bd8d04e68a29a670522868b9138650e5be5d6098cef0", "ja": "任せろ！", "zh": "交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9c30c1684bfd9905fd77b5eeb784d0e7ca3c05809f29328a2a51865e73f699f7", "ja": "まず……この衣装と瑞希のクールな雰囲気が\nマッチしていて、大人っぽい魅力が出てると思う。", "zh": "首先……我觉得这套服装与瑞希帅气的气质\n很相衬，展现出了一种成熟的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c8b382b0ba8ee7894fda7b3ce6df267943d694e526900ce69efb987456dfac24", "ja": "それでいて、可愛さも感じられるところもいいな。\n瑞希の持つ、多面性が引き出されて……。", "zh": "同时还能感受到可爱，这一点也很棒。瑞希所拥有的多面性也被展现出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2002_p", "source_sha256": "afb8fbcda688e86089ad9dc85498298d672a041dd8cb5cca31220135742f5e73", "ja": "あれ？　瑞希？　聞いてるか？", "zh": "咦？瑞希？你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2003_044miz", "source_sha256": "cd47cfdf531a1c6051e36a304d3ae3c6193a6d1abbc23b1f51b8a737727069e2", "ja": "…………はっ。\nすみません、{$P$}。", "zh": "…………啊。\n不好意思，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "d97219213146d3580570696df6e5ba33adb7b8aa968af02ed549873931d504b8", "ja": "私からお願いしたことでしたが、まさか\nこんなに褒めていただけるとは思っていなかったので。", "zh": "虽然是我主动提出请求的，但没想到\n您会给予这么多的称赞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2005_044miz", "source_sha256": "e758f43be725afc87fc1ba0092efe5e28d4eaddcb4ba88ff41910da48ba5bb83", "ja": "嬉しい言葉の連続で……なんだか、ポカポカを\n通り越して、熱くなってきてしまいました。", "zh": "听到您接连夸我这么开心的话……总觉得，\n已经不止是心里暖洋洋的，整个人都要发烫了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2006_p", "source_sha256": "687a1c6eb78b59ad3ccd4f82662a5334f4c15ec910e1caa72599bcd3aaab0138", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。\nでも、まだまだ褒め足りないぐらいだけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？\n不过，要夸的话，还远远不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2007_044miz", "source_sha256": "da8e60ebfd6c261848d9bc1c9f46c4927b359b9fdc1016dd629dfa266bf27e2d", "ja": "まだまだ？　すごく気になるぞ……ごくり。\n{$P$}、それではこうしましょう。", "zh": "还没完？我很在意后面会是什么……咕咚。\n{$P$}，那就这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2008_044miz", "source_sha256": "1a11cef19d62af7b28acc5582b20ad99af628fe20ee162bb0441c6d3f163a32e", "ja": "撮影がうまくいったら、続きを聞かせてください。\n……冷却シート、たくさん用意しておきます。", "zh": "拍摄顺利的话，请把后续也告诉我。\n……我会准备很多降温贴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0614_2009_p", "source_sha256": "bc47511c76244b0104f059895351519d7967513fde2138f2f4bdbceee21f73ea", "ja": "（撮影後は、褒める部分が増えてそうな気もするけど。\n瑞希の自信に繋がるなら、いくらでも伝えよう！）", "zh": "（感觉拍摄结束后，能夸的地方好像也会变多。不过，只要能让瑞希更有自信，我愿意告诉她多少都行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
